#**
 * Convenience directive to invoke a method and ignore the return value.
 *
 * Usage:
 *    #call ( $hashtable.put("foo", "bar") )
 *###
#macro ( call $foo )##
#*  *##if ($foo)##
#*  *### do nothing - the 'if' is for ignoring the return value
#*  *##end##
#end##
